2:T435,{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fblog\u002Fthe-best-common-room-alternatives#article","headline":"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026","name":"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026","description":"Common Room captures the signal, but you still have to act on it. The best alternatives turn signals into fully-run outreach, compared honestly.","image":["https:\u002F\u002Fimages.ctfassets.net\u002Fkyprwggh4muz\u002F4blGjTMzI7f3Am2YfZkGKI\u002Fd2ce8bee2ea1dffdc39a64f83bcb18a2\u002Fthe-best-common-room-alternatives-cover.png"],"datePublished":"2026-09-17","dateModified":"2026-09-17","author":[{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fauthors\u002Fjaspar-carmichael-jack#person","name":"Jaspar Carmichael-Jack","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fauthors\u002Fjaspar-carmichael-jack"}],"publisher":{"@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002F#organization"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fblog\u002Fthe-best-common-room-alternatives"}4:T42f,Most sales tools automate tasks. Ava owns the entire BDR job. She finds best-fit leads from a database of over 250 million B2B professionals across over 200 countries, plus Artisan Local Data with over 250 million local businesses, using intent signals like funding rounds, leadership hires, and website visits, then enriches them with verified emails and AI web research. She runs personalized campaigns across email and social outreach, continuously testing dozens of message variations and shifting volume toward what converts. Calling is built into the platform too: Ava auto-triggers call steps on engagement and dials them, then a rep takes the live conversation. She handles every reply against a knowledge base and books qualified meetings directly on reps' calendars. Ava Inbound extends the same platform to your website: live chat that greets and qualifies visitors, answers from the same knowledge base, and books meetings with CRM-owner routing, so inbound and outbound run on the same platform. Inbound and outbound both run on the same usage-based pricing.0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"id":"article-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script",null,{"id":"breadcrumb-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\\u002Fthe-best-common-room-alternatives\"}]}"}}],["$","$L3",null,{"post":{"id":"6jOmBBZUsv5KcJYS6ERNx8","slug":"the-best-common-room-alternatives","title":"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026","metaTitle":"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026","publishedDate":"2026-09-17","seoDescription":"Common Room captures the signal, but you still have to act on it. The best alternatives turn signals into fully-run outreach, compared honestly.","readTime":"7 minutes","tag":"Sales","keyTakeAways":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"6JrlRadzt0HnASWcHIP2hi","type":"Entry","createdAt":"2026-09-17T04:31:47.473Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-17T04:31:47.473Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":1,"revision":1,"contentType":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"ContentType","id":"blogKeyTakeaways"}},"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"keyTakeAways":[{"keyTakeAways":"Common Room is person-level signal intelligence reportedly starting around $2,500 per month, strong at stitching community, product, and web signals into one view."},{"keyTakeAways":"Zoom agreed to acquire Common Room, announced July 2, 2026, which brings post-merger roadmap uncertainty new buyers should factor in."},{"keyTakeAways":"The recurring gap is activation. Common Room surfaces the signal; a rep still has to research, write, and send. Pipeline scales with rep hours."},{"keyTakeAways":"Artisan captures the same class of signals, funding, hiring, tech-stack, topic intent, champion job changes, visitor identification, and has Ava run the outreach the moment a signal fires."},{"keyTakeAways":"Autonomy is a dial from review-and-approve to fully autonomous, with plain-language escalation rules and a full audit trail."},{"keyTakeAways":"Unify automates plays but still needs ops configuration; Clay is the enrichment workbench, not a worker; UserGems is a standalone champion feed."}],"blogName":"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026"}},"heroImage":{"url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/4blGjTMzI7f3Am2YfZkGKI/d2ce8bee2ea1dffdc39a64f83bcb18a2/the-best-common-room-alternatives-cover.png","width":2389,"height":1120,"title":"The best Common Room alternatives in 2026"},"content":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"The best Common Room alternative is Artisan, because it does not stop at the signal. Common Room is excellent at capturing buying signals from community, product usage, and across the web, but every signal still needs a human to act on it. Artisan turns each signal into fully-run outreach through Ava, its AI BDR. Unify, Clay, and UserGems each own a narrower part of the job.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"How the Common Room alternatives compare","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-2"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Rank","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":